  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "A procedure step in the PTI directed the Non-Licensed Operator (NLO) to Unlock and Close the Transfer Line Isolation valve. The NLO unlocked the valve but failed to close the valve. A subsequent step opened the Transfer Line Outboard Containment Isolation valve aligning the discharge of the running transfer pump to the SLC Storage Tank, which caused the Storage Tank to fill with water from the Transfer Tank.",
    "cause_code": "TBD",
    "category": "provisional",
    "theme": "Valve mis-position due to human error during periodic test, compounded by inadequate risk classification of the procedure",
    "provisional": true
  },
